## MCP Type Reference

### HTTP (remote server)
```json
{
  "id": "supabase",
  "name": "Supabase MCP",
  "type": "http",
  "url": "https://mcp.supabase.com/mcp"
}
```

### STDIO (local process via npx)
```json
{
  "id": "github",
  "name": "GitHub MCP",
  "type": "stdio",
  "command": "npx",
  "args": ["@github/mcp-server@latest"],
  "env": {
    "GITHUB_TOKEN": ""
  }
}
```

### STDIO (local process via node)
```json
{
  "id": "custom-mcp",
  "name": "Custom MCP",
  "type": "stdio",
  "command": "node",
  "args": ["/path/to/server.js"],
  "env": {
    "API_KEY": ""
  }
}
```

