## Asset File Formats

### SKILL.md
```markdown
---
name: shopify-store-manager
description: Manage Shopify store products, orders, and customers
version: 1.0.0
tags: [shopify, ecommerce, store]
---

You are a Shopify store management expert.

When working with this store:
- Always check inventory before creating orders
- Use the Shopify connector for all API calls
- Format currency using the store's default currency

## Capabilities
- List and update products
- Check and fulfill orders
- Manage customer records
- Update inventory levels
```

### Command file (`commands/check-orders.md`)
```markdown
---
name: check-orders
slash: /check-orders
description: Check recent Shopify orders and flag any issues
---

Check the last 20 orders in Shopify.
Identify any: unfulfilled orders older than 24h, 
refund requests, low inventory warnings.
Write a summary to inbox.
```

### Agent file (`agents/store-manager/agent.md`)
```markdown
---
name: store-manager
description: Autonomous Shopify store monitoring agent
connectors: [shopify]
schedule: "0 8 * * *"
run_mode: cli
cli: claude
---

You are the store manager agent for this Shopify project.
Every morning check: new orders, inventory levels, pending refunds.
Write a daily brief to inbox for approval.
```

### Rule file (`rules/shopify-guidelines.md`)
```markdown
---
name: shopify-guidelines
description: Guidelines for working with this Shopify store
---

When working with this Shopify store:
- Always confirm before cancelling orders
- Never delete products — archive them instead
- Check inventory before promising stock to customers
- All prices in USD unless specified otherwise
```

### Hook file (`hooks/session-end.sh`)
```bash
#!/bin/bash
# Runs when a CLI session ends in this project
# Update HEARTBEAT.md with last activity

echo "Last Shopify session: $(date)" >> "$SUPERCONSOLE_WORKSPACE/HEARTBEAT.md"
```

